  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Sventusk's Gem\n  | type                     = Trinket\n  | minlevel                 = 11\n  | slot                     = Trinket\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoA|exclusive=1}}\n  | durability               = 71\n  | material                 = Gem\n  | hardness                 = 27\n  | basevalue                = 4,920 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | quest                    = Ruins of Gianthold\n  | chest                    = possible drop from Rare Encounter chest\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = None\n  | description              = This white gem is infused with a great deal of power from an ancient source. It may be able to be used as a component for a ritual.\n  | pic                      = Gem Generic Pearl.png\n  | picdesc                  = Item Sventusks Gem.png\n  | tips                     = Thear gives you a quest, [[The Essence of a Dragon]], and asks you to collect gems found in the [[Wilderness Adventure Area|Exploration Zones]]. The gems drop out of rare encounter treasure chests in these zones. Once you get gems and turn them in, you never need to repeat this process. As of [[Module 9]], you only need any three of these six gems. (Additional gems may be sold or fed to [[Sentient Weapon#Sentient Jewels|Sentient Jewel]]s.)[[Category:The Essence of a Dragon gems]]\n\n* {{Item|Aussiredar's Gem}} (white) - [[Aussircaex's Valley]]\n* {{Item|Iskaryte's Gem}} (blue) - [[Mount Reysalon]]\n* {{Item|Omaekrix's Gem}} (blue) - [[Soami Gardens]]\n* {{Item|Sventusk's Gem}} (white) - [[Ruins of Gianthold]]\n* {{Item|Thadargix's Gem}} (black) - [[Sands of Menechtarun]]\n* {{Item|Vuthesjing's Gem}} (black) - [[Orchard of the Macabre]]\n}}\n[[Category:Quest items]]",
